WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.059
Explain how to make and maintain a simple garden.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.931
A garden is a place where useful or beautiful plants are grown. Choose a suitable

00:00:08.931 --> 00:00:13.032
safe site, prepare the soil with an adult and plant seeds or seedlings.

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:18.346
Plants need appropriate water, light and care. We can remove weeds, observe growth

00:00:18.346 --> 00:00:20.757
and keep rubbish away from the garden.

00:00:21.617 --> 00:00:26.295
Plant seeds in a reused pot with a teacher; observe and record their growth for a

00:00:26.295 --> 00:00:26.587
week.
